  "description": "Powerful 250W Motor for Daily Commutes & Trail Adventures\n\nExperience effortless riding. The high-performance 250W motor delivers smooth and reliable power assistance, making it perfect for city commuting, daily urban trips, and exploring light off-road trails.\n\nLong-Lasting 10.4Ah Battery for Extended Rides\n\nFuel your journey with confidence. The seamlessly integrated 10.4Ah battery ensures a stable, long-lasting power supply—ideal for your daily routine, leisure rides, and weekend adventures.\n\nLightweight Aluminum Frame & Agile 27.5\" Tires\n\nEngineered for the perfect balance of durability and control. The lightweight yet robust alloy frame ensures easy handling, while the 27.5-inch wheels offer excellent traction, stability, and responsiveness on any terrain.\n\nHydraulic Disc Brakes & Smooth 7-Speed Gearing\n\nUltimate safety and versatility in all weather conditions. High-precision hydraulic disc brakes provide superior stopping power, while the 7-speed drivetrain allows for effortless shifting to conquer hills and flats alike.\n\n85% Pre-Assembled (SKD) for Quick Setup\n\nGet on the road in no time. The e-bike arrives 85% pre-assembled, making the final DIY assembly straightforward and time-saving. Perfect for a quick, hassle-free start right out of the box.",
